Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:48.81,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.53,0:01:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to keep your strength up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉 你听说过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, did you…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:02:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这真是个传奇故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过肖恩以前偷金斯利车的那件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever hear about the time Shane stole Kingsley's car?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时 校长的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The principal's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就停在教职工停车场那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}right out of the teacher's lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还是学生时代的一个中午\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the middle of a school day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩出去吃午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane steps out of lunch and makes a beeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后直奔金斯利的那辆现代\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Kingsley's Hyundai…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动车 火速开动 沿着迪伦大道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wires the ignition, peels out, drives down Dylan drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,直奔那儿的一个养鸡场\N{\fnArial\fs30}to that chicken farm out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前听过这个故事的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard this before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把那车停在一个很大的鸡舍里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he pulls it into one of the big holding pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,金斯利每个月给那车打一次蜡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kingsley, he waxed that thing every month;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,每周送到车店里清理一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}had the auto shop vacuum it out every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩就把那车停在那个大鸡舍里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, he parks it in this huge pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,和几百只洛岛红鸡搁一块儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a couple of hundred rhode island reds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把车后座上装满种子的袋子撕开\N{\fnArial\fs30}He busts open bags of seed in the back seat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.33,0:02:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把玻璃窗降下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}rolls down all the windows,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.74,0:02:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后狂奔回学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then starts sprinting back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那段路少说也有3英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's three miles away easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.41,0:02:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他赶在上课铃响之前跑了回来 还吃完了三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's back in time to finish his sandwich before the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后上课铃响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the bell rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在走廊里碰到了金斯利校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane gets up and when he runs into Kingsley in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.07,0:03:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他站起来 看着窗外说道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks out the window and says,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.03,0:03:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,「金斯利校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Principal Kingsley,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的坐骑不见了「\N{\fnArial\fs30}your coupe's gone."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐骑 听着就跟说鸡舍似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coupe, like chicken coop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然听得懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.69,0:03:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这故事你都听了上千遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard this story 1000 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的那些话 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you said before, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.43,0:03:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩会带着医生需要的东西回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane's gonna make it back with what the doctor needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会平安回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔说你需要吃些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel said you need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 就当是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定得挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to keep your strength up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的弹夹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my clip now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去路边 去找那小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna walk the road, look for the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去走走 在树林里面亮几束光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going for a walk. Shine some light in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她在那儿 方便她看得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's out there, give her something to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得现在这能算个好主意吗 - 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think that's a good idea right now? - Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的几个窗户 外面是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those windows, what's on the other side?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那窗户大概20英尺高\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a 20-foot drop with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面没有啥着落点 也许有些灌木丛\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing to catch you, maybe some bushes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后就是运动场了 - 我们需要足够的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then the athletic field. - We just need enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须去那边 打开窗户 然后跳出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get up there. We got to get 'em open and get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行 也许你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me. Maybe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说什么呢 - 得了吧 你看我这体型\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey hey hey. - Come on, man, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I can squeeze through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那么小的窗户眼儿挤出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them tiny windows?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些行尸都围着我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd be all over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们得点几堆火 引他们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we lay down some fire to get a head start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这儿 我跳下去把它们引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here. I hop down and draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gives you the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上那个看台 从窗户跳出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get up the bleachers and out a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where do you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去更衣室那边 就在那楼梯下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locker room down those steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那好像很容易被困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a good way to get trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里也有窗户 比较符合我的尺寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got windows too, and more my size.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从窗户钻出去 然后沿原路返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get out through one, I double back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在外面碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}we meet up out on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈真是疯了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a crazy son of a bitch, ain't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想为那个小孩做点好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to do right for that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对着它们放三枪 然后走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take three shots and you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我再开枪 掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that I fire. I'll lay down a cover for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你引个路 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get you a lead. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.89,0:08:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要按门铃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do we ring the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这里好像住着人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it looks like people live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不必多此一举了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're past this kind of stuff, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经很善解人意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having to be considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们开车进来时关上大门了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you close the gate up the road when you drove in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we closed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,插了门闩 都关好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the latch and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 很高兴再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前简短地打过照面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met before briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来帮忙的 有需要我们做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we came to help. There anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.81,0:09:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是咬伤 我自己不小心割伤的很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a bite. I cut myself pretty bad though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得好好看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have it looked at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去告诉他们你们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell them you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿有些止痛药和抗生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have some painkillers and antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经给他吃了一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already gave him some.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果卡尔需要就拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Carl needs any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进来 我给你们做点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on inside. I'll make you something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我们在 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we're here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还不赶紧回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't get back soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就得做个决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna have a decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没有呼吸机的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether to operate on your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要给你们的儿子动手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the respirator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说过这行不通的 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said that wouldn't work. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这确实不大可能 但我们不能多等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's extremely unlikely. But we can't wait much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得我们会找到索菲亚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think we're gonna find Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脸上的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟其他人没两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}same as everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些人到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们才刚开始找呢 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We just started looking. - Well, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又不是在西藏的某座山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't the mountains of Tibet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是乔治亚州\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Georgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能在某个农家小屋待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be holed up in a farmhouse somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们迷路 又幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}People get lost and they survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这种事时有发生 - 她才十二岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It happens all the time. - She's only 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 我走丢的时候比她还小呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I was younger than her and I got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.83,0:11:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在丛林里九天 就吃浆果度日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine days in the woods eating berries,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:11:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,用毒橡树叶擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiping my ass with poison oak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们后来找到你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爸和女招待去饮酒作乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old man was off on a bender with some waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔被关在少管所里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle was doing another stint in juvie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没发现我不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't even know I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.47,0:12:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己找到了回来的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my way back though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接去厨房给自己做了个三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went straight into the kitchen and made myself a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像什么都没发生过一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worse for wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我的屁股痒得死去活来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except my ass itched something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你的故事真凄惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, that is a terrible story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一不同的是 索菲亚起码还有人去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only difference is Sophia's got people looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是有利的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call that an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这不再是孩子们的世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this isn't a world for children anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah well, we have a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔在此时生在这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl is here in this world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他不该出生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这是命中注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe is is how it's supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是认真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解你 那念头一闪而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can understand that thought crossing your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一闪而过的 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't cross my mind, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忍不住一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop thinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要让卡尔活在这样的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we want Carl to live in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,过着这样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have this life?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他亲眼看到更多人被撕成碎片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he can see more people torn apart in front of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让他挨饿 还担惊受怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that he can be hungry and scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到他被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For however long he has before he…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能做的除了逃 还是逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he can run and run and run and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使最后幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then even if he survives he ends up…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.63,0:13:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果也不过是成为另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ends up just another.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了生存什么也不知道的行尸罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}animal who doesn't know anything except survival?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他今晚没撑过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he dies tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说就解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ends for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是说啊 为什么活着更好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why it would be better another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.81,0:14:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.27,0:14:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹纳曾给我们指了条出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenner offered us a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你求他让我们继续尝试下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked him to let us keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恳求他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You begged him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说「要尽我们所能」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For as long as we can."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么改变了你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said. What changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 某一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a moment the other day…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么一秒钟 我忘了杰奎已经去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a second but I forgot Jacqui was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我转过身想和她说点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned around, I wanted to tell her something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎叫出来她的名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost said her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎叫出来她的名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a second and then I remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.81,0:14:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我意识到她再也不用看这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I realized she didn't have to see any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路 尸群 索菲亚 卡尔受枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The highway, the herds, sophia, carl getting shot…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用不着再害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have to be afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥饿 愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry. Angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻伴随 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn't stopped happening, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像每时每刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we live with a.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有一把刀架在我们的脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}knife at our throats every second of every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但杰奎不用这么活 再也不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Jacqui doesn't. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:14:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 也许詹纳是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, "Maybe Jenner was right."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认命了 他不\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man surrendered. It doesn't matt…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.13,0:15:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的话没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.55,0:15:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一点意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果卡尔…如果我们就这么放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think it would be better if Carl…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为这样更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we just gave up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我 如果不这样的话会好到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why it would be better the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I thought I'd lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最后一个弹匣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my last rifle round.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mine too. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在哪 - 嘿 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - Hey, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在他家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出了点意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好点了吗 - 疼 非常疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? - It hurts, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh baby, I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真应该亲眼看看 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should have seen it. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它特别美 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so pretty, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动他 是癫痫发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. It's a seizure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.09,0:18:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果按住他 会伤到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hold him down, you could hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让它停下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须自己挺过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to just go through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大脑供血不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}His brain isn't getting enough blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压太低了 需要再输一次血\N{\fnArial\fs30}His pressure is bottoming. He needs another transfusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 来抽吧 - 如果你再失血的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, I'm ready. - If I take any more out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:19:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身体会受不住的 可能会昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}your body could shut down. You could go into a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者心跳暂停 - 别浪费时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or cardiac arrest. - You're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 老兄 我们得离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. We need a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我喘口气 - 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just let me catch my breath. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.41,0:20:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要等他们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna wait for them to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意的话 可以下去睡会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go down and sleep if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 我们一块等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can keep watch together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.15,0:20:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们往哪个方向走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「被咬了 发高烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Got bit. Fever hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界太恐怖了 我还是退出吧「\N{\fnArial\fs30}World gone to shit. Might as well quit."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这蠢货都不知道得射脑袋才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumbass didn't know enough to shoot himself in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.66,0:21:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己挂在树上 变成招摇的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turned himself into a big swinging piece of bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.89,0:21:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力不吐出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying not to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想吐就吐吧 - 不 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go ahead if you gotta. - No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们聊点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just talk about something else for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么学会射击的 - 我得吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you learn to shoot? - Gotta eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们和行尸的共同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one thing these walkers and us have in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是他变行尸后第一次离食物这么近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's the closest he's been to food since he turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.07,0:21:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他挂在那 好像一个大皮纳塔（墨西哥玩具）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanging up there like a big pinata.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他行尸把他腿上的肉都给吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other geeks came and ate all the flesh off his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.99,0:22:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为咱们换了话题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were changing the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是笑我屁股痒的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call that payback for laughing about my itchy ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那事不经常发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There wasn't a lot that came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.93,0:22:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他不会伤害其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He ain't hurting nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.62,0:22:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得费一支箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't gonna waste an arrow either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做出了自己的选择 退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made his choice. Opted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他在那挂着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.06,0:22:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要继续活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to live now or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.45,0:22:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.09,0:22:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回答你 你射死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}An answer for an arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,公平吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.77,0:23:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道自己想不想要活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.23,0:23:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者有没有必要活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许活着只是一种习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if it's just a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.23,0:23:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个答案不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much of an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪费一支箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waste of an arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.17,0:23:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心 她和达里尔在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to worry. She's with daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有危险他会保护她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If something happens he can protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到我说的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.49,0:23:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只听到如果有事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, all I heard was if something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我看会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind keeping watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.23,0:23:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.03,0:23:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会儿就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be gone long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.77,0:23:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你发现情况就大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see anything, call out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.55,0:23:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会走远的 听得见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going far. I'll hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来得真及时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got here right in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.12,0:24:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不救治你就不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This couldn't go untreated much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.85,0:24:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔·迪克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Merle Dixon."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.37,0:24:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这抗生素的主人是你们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your friend with the antibiotics?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.66,0:24:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 太太 莫尔不跟我们在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, ma'am. Merle's no longer with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.35,0:24:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是达里尔给的 他弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl gave us those… his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.33,0:24:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不确定他算不算朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure I'd call him a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.95,0:24:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天一定是 强力霉素今天救了你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is today. This doxycycline might have just saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.94,0:24:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道莫尔为什么吃这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what Merle was taking it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.92,0:24:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,淋病\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.25,0:24:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,性病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, venereal disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Daryl said.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔·迪克森的淋病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say Merle Dixon's clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.30,0:24:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你最好的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the best thing to ever happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.00,0:24:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不要这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really trying not to think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.94,0:25:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在祈祷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you praying?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.33,0:25:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什你老爱偷看别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you sneak up on people so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.02,0:25:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很容易被人偷看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're easy to sneak up on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.84,0:25:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.92,0:25:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在尝试祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.87,0:25:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信教吗 你常常祈祷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You religious? You pray a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实这是我第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually this was my first try.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.21,0:25:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.35,0:25:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.81,0:25:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意来搅黄你的第一次的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to wreck your first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.49,0:25:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝大概已经收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God probably got the gist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.99,0:25:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么祈祷 - 为我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Praying for what? - My friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.89,0:25:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他们现在都挺需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they could all use a little help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.70,0:25:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.44,0:25:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为上帝真的存在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think god exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.33,0:26:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前非常相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always took it on faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近我开始怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lately I've wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看发生的这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that's happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.60,0:26:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定大家一直都在祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}there must have been a lot of praying going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.53,0:26:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但上帝并没给予多少答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems quite a few went unanswered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.45,0:26:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你还真帮了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. This is really helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.94,0:26:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.29,0:26:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.94,0:26:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去帮你倒水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you a refill instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.51,0:26:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不关我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.50,0:26:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,信不信上帝是个人自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}and feel free to believe in god,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.60,0:26:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不管情况有多糟糕 你都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the thing is you've got to make it okay somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.44,0:26:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己想办法解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.11,0:27:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他中枪前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.14,0:27:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们站在丛林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were standing there in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.32,0:27:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有头鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.17,0:27:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走到我们面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}just crossed right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.66,0:27:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓它就站在那儿一动不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear it just planted itself there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧紧盯着卡尔看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and looked Carl right in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.41,0:28:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I looked at Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.17,0:28:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔看着鹿 鹿也看着卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking at that deer, and that deer looking right back at Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.84,0:28:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个瞬间只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that moment just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.28,0:28:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹那而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}slipped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.58,0:28:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹那而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It slipped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.05,0:28:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒来就谈起这一瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he was talking about when he woke up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.18,0:28:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是中枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}not about getting shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.41,0:28:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是教堂里的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what happened at the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.25,0:28:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是美好的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talked about something beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.90,0:28:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有生命力的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}something living.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能有美好生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still a life for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.84,0:28:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个像这样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}a place maybe like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.04,0:28:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没到死绝的地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't all death out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.85,0:28:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须坚强一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to be strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.89,0:28:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历这些以后我们还可以相信奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything we've seen to still believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.67,0:28:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我为什么卡尔活着比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it better for Carl to live even in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.74,0:29:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他谈起了那头鹿 洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talked about the deer, lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.83,0:29:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他竟然谈起了那头鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talked about the deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.14,0:29:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须走到街上 然后返回到卡车那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to get to the street, double back to the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.80,0:29:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们到不了了 - 那也得试试 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, we ain't gonna make it, okay? - Got to try, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.22,0:29:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油 起来 - 你来拿这些包\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, get up. - You're gonna take these bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.00,0:29:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后往前走 - 我不会丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you're gonna go. - I ain't leaving you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.05,0:29:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.67,0:29:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有几发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many rounds you got left?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.71,0:29:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,四发 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,五发 还有一发在枪膛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five and one in the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.07,0:30:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失血的速度比我们补充的还快\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still losing blood faster than we can replace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.44,0:30:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他腹腔积水\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with the swelling in his abdomen,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.71,0:30:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.33,0:30:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他会没命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he's just going to slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在必须知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I need to know right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.75,0:30:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是否希望我动刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want me to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.46,0:30:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我觉得这孩子时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I think your boy is out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.55,0:30:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.92,0:30:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 选择 - 选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A choice? - A choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.80,0:30:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须告诉我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.39,0:30:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须告诉我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.24,0:30:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手术吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.26,0:30:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 都站到床角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, get the corner of that bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.81,0:30:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把床单扯下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the sheets down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.99,0:30:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,输液袋放到床单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the I.V. bag on the sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.09,0:30:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.32,0:30:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.72,0:30:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.94,0:31:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, Lori,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.92,0:31:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还是回避一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may want to step out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.43,0:31:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下来看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.12,0:31:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔怎样了 - 还有救\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl? - There's still a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.19,0:31:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥蒂斯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.05,0:31:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.10,0:32:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉帕特里夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We say nothing to Patricia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.52,0:32:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,事后再说 我现在需要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not till after. I need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.37,0:32:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个拐弯都有行尸围堵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kept blocking us at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.70,0:32:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们弹尽粮绝 只剩十发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had nothing left. We were down to 10 rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.99,0:32:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他说 他说他掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he said… he said he'd cover me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.75,0:32:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我继续往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I should keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.56,0:32:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就这么做了 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what I did. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.62,0:32:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我继续向前 可我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept going. But I…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.16,0:32:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回头看 而他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked back and he…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.86,0:32:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.27,0:33:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是想弥补自己的过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.70,0:33:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚 等会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔 你又想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.01,0:33:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}To give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.87,0:34:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.18,0:34:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才替你做了那个决定 那些决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I made a choice for you… choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.67,0:34:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我为何这么做 但这不是我的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why I did it, but this is not my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.55,0:34:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且那些我替你做的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the choices that I made for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.99,0:34:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不该由我来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}were not mine to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.11,0:34:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can still ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.96,0:34:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是要让你内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is not to make you guilty,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.49,0:34:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是要抬高我自己 但我还是要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or put me ahead of you, but I can still ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.11,0:34:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.85,0:34:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我后悔这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.00,0:34:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你原谅我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do you forgive me for…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.60,0:34:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你原谅我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.39,0:34:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.95,0:35:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就认识奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known Otis since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.70,0:35:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲去世前 他就在打理这个农场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's run this farm since before my mother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.42,0:35:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.03,0:35:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还失去了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd you lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.07,0:35:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我得自己想办法解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me I had to make it okay somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.15,0:35:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一直在努力这么做 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you've been trying to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.58,0:35:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.52,0:35:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,继母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stepmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.79,0:35:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,同父异母的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.87,0:36:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他病情已经稳定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to have stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.21,0:36:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.76,0:36:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道要说什么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have words.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.79,0:36:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 真希望我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't either. Wish I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.60,0:36:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么和帕特里夏说奥蒂斯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I tell Patricia about Otis?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.53,0:36:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去看卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go to Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.48,0:36:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和赫谢尔去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.60,0:38:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.70,0:38:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,浴室在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bathroom's upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.90,0:38:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你找了些衣服 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I brought you some clothes. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.21,0:38:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服不太合身 是奥蒂斯的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't fit well. They were Otis's.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.57,0:39:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还剩几发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many rounds you got left?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.53,0:39:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,四发 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.85,0:39:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,五发 还有一发上膛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five and one in the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.13,0:39:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.63,0:40:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就剩一发了 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Down to my last. - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.33,0:40:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.98,0:40:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you give it… ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.15,0:40:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.87,0:41:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.40,0:41:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me! Let go!
